[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637765921","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102464#issuecomment-2637765921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102464","id":2637765921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dOR0h","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T18:56:01Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T18:56:01Z","body":"This is not specific to 4.4, happens in 4.3.stable as well","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637765921/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637926764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102464#issuecomment-2637926764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102464","id":2637926764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dO5Fs","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T20:11:54Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T20:55:08Z","body":"The `make_polygons_from_outlines()` function is marked as `Deprecated` since Godot 4.2. It only exists to give older projects an update warning with clear steps what to use instead. Apart from that it should no longer be used for anything.\n\nThe navmesh documentation has multiple working script examples how to create or bake procedual navmesh.\n\nIn general a convex partition fails when outlines can not be converted into valid triangles or convex polygon without self-overlap.\n\nSuch errors are commonly caused by creating edge overlap or by having perfectly axis-aligned geometry running into precision issues, aka typical stack of nested grid-aligned pixel boxes. Such geometry has the core flaw with outline based boolean ops that it is going for coin flip interpretation so you have a 50:50 chance to break things randomly. If you really need such shapes add a small random float amount to the positions to create some margin and it does not happen.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637926764/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2639559114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102464#issuecomment-2639559114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102464","id":2639559114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dVHnK","user":{"login":"42juododranoel","id":25154783,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTU0Nzgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25154783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel","html_url":"https://github.com/42juododranoel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-06T11:27:13Z","updated_at":"2025-02-06T11:27:13Z","body":"Thank you, I will look into it","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2639559114/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642777216","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102464#issuecomment-2642777216","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102464","id":2642777216,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dhZSA","user":{"login":"42juododranoel","id":25154783,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTU0Nzgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25154783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel","html_url":"https://github.com/42juododranoel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/42juododranoel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T12:21:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T12:21:33Z","body":"For anyone who comes across this in the future, here's the code that is seemingly the currently preferred solution to this problem. Not sure why, but my initial research and googling kept leading me to the NavigationPolygon docs that showcased generic `add_outline` and `add_polygon` methods. In reality, this kind of thing should be actually done using the specialized NavigationMeshSourceGeometryData2D methods as shown below\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tvar new_navigation_polygon = NavigationPolygon.new()\n\tvar source_geometry_data = NavigationMeshSourceGeometryData2D.new()\n\t\n\t# Create outer boundary\n\tvar outer_boundary = PackedVector2Array([\n\t\tVector2(0, 0),\n\t\tVector2(0, 1000),\n\t\tVector2(1000, 1000),\n\t\tVector2(1000, 0),\n\t])\n\tsource_geometry_data.add_traversable_outline(outer_boundary)\n\t\n\t# Create a test rectangle\n\tvar test_hole = PackedVector2Array([\n\t\tVector2(100, 100),\n\t\tVector2(100, 900),\n\t\tVector2(900, 900),\n\t\tVector2(900, 100)\n\t])\n\tsource_geometry_data.add_obstruction_outline(test_hole)\n\t\n\t# Bake\n\tNavigationServer2D.bake_from_source_geometry_data(\n\t\tnew_navigation_polygon, \n\t\tsource_geometry_data,\n\t\tfunc():\n\t\t\t# Debug output\n\t\t\tprint(\"Total outlines: \", new_navigation_polygon.get_outline_count())\n\t\t\tprint(\"Total vertices: \", new_navigation_polygon.get_vertices().size())\n\t\t\tprint(\"Total polygons: \", new_navigation_polygon.get_polygon_count())\n\t)\n\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2642777216/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]